{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都個握！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4部 お団子\n5部 ツインテール"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/09/03/1390272/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トップス bulle de savon\nスカート ARMEN\nサンダル FABIO RUSUCONI"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お風呂あがり？\nってめっちゃからかわれた笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃうよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/09/03/1390272/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バンダナ可愛く巻いたんだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/09/03/1390272/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"50's！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツアーの感想など、\nありがとうございました！\n元気になりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"代々木に向けて気持ち切り替えます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カチッ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/09/03/1390272/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さーゆーりーさん\nそうそう、\nこの前2人でカフェ行ったの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/09/03/1390272/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかった楽しかった♪ふぉほほ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/09/03/1390272/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゅんな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/09/03/1390272/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/09/03/1390272/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/09/03/1390272/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/09/03/1390272/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな目がキラキラしてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえばアメブロの方にも\nブログ書きました。\nそちらもぜひ読んでください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/09/03/1390272/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木ここも映り込んでるので、\n見てくださいっ\nあみちゃんお疲れちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}